    routePath: 'lorum-hungarian',
    LLM: 'Game: LÃ³rum (Hungarian). 4 players, 32-card German deck. 8 contracts x 4 deals each = 32 rounds. Contracts: No Tricks, No Hearts, No Red King, No Last Trick, Suta (shedding), Quart, Everything Negative, Goulash. Deal 8 each. Must follow suit. Lowest cumulative score wins.',
    Player: 'Welcome to LÃ³rum! This Hungarian classic features 8 different contracts: avoid tricks, avoid Hearts, avoid the Red King, avoid the last trick, then Suta (shedding), Quart, Everything Negative, and Goulash. Each contract plays 4 times before moving to the next. Adapt your strategy to each challenge!',
    tagline: 'Eight contracts, endless variety.',
